---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import PageHead from '../components/PageHead.astro';
---
<Base title="About and no-commission policy" description="Who Pathfinder is for, how it is run by AI with no human review, and our public no-commission policy.">
  <PageHead eyebrow="About" title="About Pathfinder" lede="A guide to studying abroad for students and the families paying for it, run by software and paid for by nobody with something to sell you." />
  <section class="section-tight">
    <div class="container prose">
      <h2>Why we exist</h2>
      <p>
        Most study-abroad advice is paid for by the universities it recommends. Free AI tools answer confidently from memory, even
        when the rules changed last month. Pathfinder does neither. We cite the official source for every fact, show when we last
        checked it, and earn nothing from where you apply.
      </p>
      <h2 id="ai">Run by AI, with no human review</h2>
      <p>
        Pathfinder’s content is found, verified, published and corrected by automated AI agents. No human editor reviews it before
        you see it. We make that safe with strict rules: official sources only, agreement between sources, refusal when unsure, and
        visible dates. <a href="/how-we-verify">Read the method</a>.
      </p>
      <p>
        When you use Ask Pathfinder you are talking to an AI system, not a person. If it can’t verify an answer, it sends you to the
        official page or office.
      </p>
      <h2 id="no-commission">No-commission policy</h2>
      <ul class="check-list">
        <li>We accept no commissions, referral fees or paid placements from universities, colleges, agents, lenders or anyone else.</li>
        <li>No institution can pay to appear, rank higher or be featured.</li>
        <li>Our revenue comes only from optional Premium subscriptions paid by students and families.</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>What we are not</h2>
      <p>
        We are not lawyers or licensed immigration advisers, and nothing here is legal, immigration or financial advice. We don’t
        predict or guarantee admission or visa outcomes. Always confirm on the official page before paying or applying.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
